  "goodToKnow": "Inbegriffen means included, used after the noun or with sein: im Preis inbegriffen, Service inbegriffen. Synonyms: inklusive (inkl.), enthalten. The opposite is nicht inbegriffen or zuzüglich (zzgl., plus). Related but different: der Inbegriff means the epitome: der Inbegriff der Eleganz. In Germany, restaurant prices always include VAT and service, but tipping (Trinkgeld) of about 5–10 percent is still common."
